  sources but I do wish there was a place  in the app to see if it was connected to  the brush and to see the remaining  battery life the package should also  include some sort of screen protector  for your phone toothpaste is not a  recommended screen cleaner the smart  series is on sale now in Europe and will  be available in the US this fall for  $159 there will be two other cheaper  blue toothbrushes coming out later this  year look how clean these teeth are sure  there are still lots of other things I'd  rather be doing for two minutes than  brushing my teeth but putting bluetooth  in a toothbrush and the phone in my hand  has certainly encouraged me to brush  longer and better now only if I could  give up these blue lollipops
 

